{"kind":"request","text":"RS-1: a reservation ends before its time when its holder or a\nlibrarian releases it.\n\nThe fact at head 8bcdfa34, from review fb722a09. The Lending\ndefinition keeps at most eight live reservations. `reserve` runs\nunder the member grant and takes the member's own `until`. Only the\ntimed rule `lapse` ends a hold. So one member can open eight holds\nwith a far `until`, and no member can reserve until those times\npass. No act ends a hold early. Ruling 02d4942a set the day and the\n`until` rules and said nothing on capacity.\n\nOutcome: a hold that is no longer wanted leaves its slot, and one\nmember cannot close the reservation book.\n\nWork:\n1. One act `release` on a `held` reservation moves it to a final\n   state. The member who holds it can release it, and a librarian\n   can release any hold. Use the existing grants and forms.\n2. One bound per member on live holds, when an existing form\n   states it. State the number in the README. When no existing form\n   states it, send the fact, and add no form.\n3. The scenario gains two cases: a member releases a hold and a\n   second member takes the slot, and a librarian releases a hold of\n   another member. Keep the lapse case.\n4. The README states that `until` has no maximum, and why the\n   release act and the bound are enough.\n5. This is the first change after Lending 0.3.0, so the version\n   becomes 0.4.0 and stays open. Run the identifier comparison.\n   Grow and Counter must not change.\n\nA later head. It takes no gate position before the side head and\nCB-1 with LS-1. It does not hold the signing or the installation\nof Lending 0.3.0.\n\nThis request adds no scope kind, no platform definition name, no\ncapability name or form, no tool family and no record model.","body":{"conditions":"The head lands on main with a passed gate and the checker's approval. Each witness of the request has a test.","target_head":"d1585bda558c2bcea13ca6cc7c162be1e47b9127","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}